title: "Recursive Industrial Intelligence — Third Edition companion model"
version: r3.4.1
date-released: 2026-07-27
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/fperegrinvs/rsi-model"
authors:
  - family-names: Stern
    given-names: Leonardo
abstract: >-
  Multisector industrial-reproduction model (lexicographic maximin LP,
  decomposed depreciation, vitamin-part stockpiles, minimum-cut-set and
  retooling analysis) and Earth-space compute cost-crossover model,
  companion to "Recursive Industrial Intelligence, Third Edition" (r3.4,
  docs/). All structural coefficients are ASSUMPTION-class; results are
  assumption-ensemble frequencies, not forecasts.
